    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d2">

                <pb facs="0025" n="759" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg759"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Alexander to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Athens</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-03-16"><hi rendition="#italic">March 16,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Trade-mark declaration considered valid here. Can reopen question, but we and
                    other nations probably lose present advantages. Shall I reopen?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Alexander.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
